NAXIS2  =                    6 / number of rows in table                        PCOUNT  =                    0 / size of special data area                      GCOUNT  =                    1 / one data group (required keyword)              TFIELDS =                    4 / number of fields in each row                   TTYPE1  = 'PARM_NAME'          / Parameter name                                 TFORM1  = '64A     '           / data format of field: ASCII Character          TTYPE2  = 'PARM_RANGE'         / HK parameter validity range                    TFORM2  = '30A     '           / data format of field: ASCII Character          TTYPE3  = 'PARM_DESC'          / Parameter description                          TFORM3  = '80A     '           / data format of field: ASCII Character          TTYPE4  = 'PARM_UNIT'          / Parameter units                                TFORM4  = '5A      '           / data format of field: ASCII Character          EXTNAME = 'AUXPAR  '           / Limits of parameters in AUX file               END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             NLOSTEVT                                                         "@ == 0  "                    "Lost Event Counter"                                                            ""  ABORTFLG                                                         "@ == 2  "                    "CCD abort readout flag"                                                        ""  FRAMETIME                                                        "@ < 150 "                    "Jitter allowed on frame readout time"                                          "ms"EVENTSIZE                                                        "@ < 2   "                    "Limit on event size after event reconstruction"                                ""  ABS_PIX_FRAME                                                    "@ < 1000"                    "Absolute limit on the number of counts per frame"                              ""  REL_PIX_FRAME                                                    "@ < 10  "                    "Relative limit on the number of counts per frame"                              ""  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀